flowchart TB
accTitle: Separate transaction load from reporting and delivery
accDescr: CRM writes remain on the primary. An asynchronous replica serves reports, whose small summaries go through an SNS confirmed email subscription.
C[CRM transactions]:::inputData --> P[(RDS MySQL primary)]:::storage
P -->|Asynchronous replication| R[(Read replica)]:::storage
J[Reporting job]:::inputData -->|Read queries| R
J -->|Small status summary| N[SNS standard topic]:::output
N -->|Confirmed email subscription| E[Operations system]:::output
